## The Counterintuitive Path to Prediction Market Profits

1two1two's verified track record demolishes the myth that successful trading requires being right most of the time. Ranking #26 with over $600K in profit while winning fewer than 40 percent of positions illustrates a deeper truth about prediction markets: they reward those who think in expected value rather than batting average. The next time you hesitate on a position because it feels more likely to lose than win, remember that one of Polymarket's most profitable traders has built a top-30 track record doing exactly that, repeatedly, with discipline and conviction. Success in prediction markets is not about certainty. It is about identifying when the odds offered exceed the true probability of an outcome, then sizing accordingly and accepting that losses are a structural feature of the strategy, not a sign of failure.

